@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<div class="wrapper">
  <h1>Fractals</h1>
  <span class="subtitle">Rendered using Blazor WASM</span>

  <p>
    This is a simple app that renders fractals using Blazor WebAssembly. The Mandelbrot set is rendered using a tile-based approach, where each tile is rendered in a separate component. The app also includes controls to adjust the view of the Mandelbrot set.
  </p>
  <p>
    The main rationale for building this app was to provide a simple application to test <a href="https://github.com/adestr/blazor-wasm-devtools">Blazor WASM Dev Tools</a>.
  </p>
</div>
